---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---

<PageLayout
  title="About"
  description="Learn more about HabitTrack — a fast, free, privacy-first monthly habit tracker built with zero tracking and offline-first IndexedDB storage."
>
  <article class="prose prose-slate dark:prose-invert max-w-none">
    <div class="mb-10 text-center sm:text-left border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-purple-900/50 pb-8">
      <span class="inline-block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-indigo-600 dark:text-purple-400 bg-indigo-50 dark:bg-purple-950/60 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-indigo-100 dark:border-purple-800/60 mb-3">
        Our Philosophy
      </span>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-purple-50">
        About HabitTrack
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-3 text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-600 dark:text-purple-200/80 leading-relaxed">
        A minimalist, distraction-free monthly habit tracker designed to build consistency without complexity.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 my-10 not-prose">
      <div class="bg-white dark:bg-[#1a0b2e] border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-purple-800/50 p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-sm">
        <div class="text-2xl mb-2">🔒</div>
        <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-800 dark:text-purple-100 mb-1">100% Private</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-purple-300">
          No sign-ups, no logins, and zero cloud databases. All your data stays strictly in your browser.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white dark:bg-[#1a0b2e] border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-purple-800/50 p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-sm">
        <div class="text-2xl mb-2">⚡</div>
        <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-800 dark:text-purple-100 mb-1">Blazing Fast</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-purple-300">
          Built with Astro and local IndexedDB. Zero network requests, instant taps, and zero latency.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white dark:bg-[#1a0b2e] border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-purple-800/50 p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-sm">
        <div class="text-2xl mb-2">📶</div>
        <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-800 dark:text-purple-100 mb-1">Works Offline</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-purple-300">
          Installable as a PWA on iOS, Android, macOS, and Windows. Check off habits without an internet connection.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <section class="space-y-6 text-slate-700 dark:text-purple-100/90 leading-relaxed">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-purple-100">Why Monthly Habit Tracking?</h2>
      <p>
        Most habit trackers push endless, fragile streak counters. Miss one day, and your 100-day streak resets to zero, causing demoralization and abandonment.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>HabitTrack is built on monthly cycles.</strong> Each month gives you a fresh visual canvas to target progress, observe daily consistency, and review your daily completion score over 28 to 31 days. Even if life gets busy for a few days, your month is still actionable and forgiving.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-purple-100 mt-8">Technical Architecture</h2>
      <p>
        HabitTrack uses modern, lightweight web technologies designed for longevity and speed:
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
        <li><strong>Astro.js:</strong> Static site shell ensuring maximum SEO performance, minimal bundle sizes, and immediate page loads.</li>
        <li><strong>IndexedDB via Dexie.js:</strong> Fast, transactional storage directly in the user's browser with structured normalized tables.</li>
        <li><strong>Tailwind CSS:</strong> Highly optimized utility styling with full light and dark purple color schemes.</li>
        <li><strong>PWA Service Worker:</strong> Service worker caching assets for resilient offline access on any device.</li>
      </ul>

      <div class="mt-10 p-6 rounded-2xl bg-indigo-50 dark:bg-purple-950/40 border border-indigo-100 dark:border-purple-800/50 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4">
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-indigo-950 dark:text-purple-100">Ready to start tracking?</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-indigo-700 dark:text-purple-300 mt-0.5">Jump right into your monthly board. No account required.</p>
        </div>
        <a
          href="/"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-700 dark:bg-purple-600 dark:hover:bg-purple-500 text-white text-sm font-semibold px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl shadow-sm transition-colors"
        >
          Open Habit Tracker →
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </article>
</PageLayout>
